tau_mem*H_Lambda = 2Z = 11.578  ->  tau_mem = 203 Gyr (can) / 168 Gyr (alt), footing-free
per-galaxy ln-scatter s_ln = hypot(s_FJ, e_sig).  Systematic floor on the contrast (quadrature proj(+)tidal): opt 2.2%  fid 5.2%  pes 8.2%

====================================================================================================
 (1) SYSTEMATIC CEILING  z_max = S/floor  (the N->infinity limit; the floor never averages down)
====================================================================================================
   If z_max < 3 the reading CANNOT reach 3sigma at ANY N; if z_max < 5, no 5sigma at any N.
   Signal at FACE VALUE (measured post-tagging contrast); purity lives in the projection floor.

   reading      S(can) |  zmax@2.2%  zmax@5.2%  zmax@8.2%   floor menu
   LOW-PASS       1.3% |       0.58       0.25       0.16   proj 1-2% (+) tidal 2-8%
   PURE-DELAY    10.5% |       4.47       1.91       1.21   proj 1-2% (+) tidal 2-8%

   LOW-PASS,   even best (F3-cleaned ~2.2%) floor:  z_max = 0.58  -> BELOW 1: undetectable at ANY N
   PURE-DELAY, fiducial (~5.2%) floor:              z_max = 1.91  -> CANNOT reach 3sigma at any N
   PURE-DELAY, F3-cleaned (~2.2%) floor:            z_max = 4.47  (band 3.44 @8% .. 5.47 @13%)

====================================================================================================
 (2) BREAK-EVEN FLOOR  floor_max = S/z_target  (max systematic that still ADMITS a detection)
====================================================================================================
   Stated floor menu: projection alone ~1-2%; tidal residual ~2-8%; quadrature ~2.2-8.3%.

   reading      S(can) |  floor<= 3s  floor<= 5s   feasibility
   LOW-PASS       1.3% |       0.43%       0.26%   3s IMPOSSIBLE: break-even below projection floor alone
   PURE-DELAY    10.5% |       3.33%       2.00%   3s feasible iff F3 drives floor to ~2%

====================================================================================================
