====================================================================================================
   fiducial per-galaxy s_ln = hypot(s_FJ 0.150, e_sig 0.050) = 0.158

   reading      floor |    Nz(3s)    Nz(5s) |  Ntot(3s)  Ntot(5s)
   LOW-PASS      2.2% |      NO N      NO N |      NO N      NO N
   LOW-PASS      5.2% |      NO N      NO N |      NO N      NO N
   LOW-PASS      8.2% |      NO N      NO N |      NO N      NO N
   PURE-DELAY    2.2% |        82      NO N |       207      NO N
   PURE-DELAY    5.2% |      NO N      NO N |      NO N      NO N
   PURE-DELAY    8.2% |      NO N      NO N |      NO N      NO N

   PURE-DELAY 3sigma @ F3-cleaned 2.2% floor: ~82 per zone  (~207 total tagged, Rhee split).
   PURE-DELAY 5sigma needs best-case (S~13%, e_sig 3%, s_FJ 0.05dex, floor 2.2%): ~290 per zone.

