 (4) REQUIRED-N vs PER-GALAXY sigma PRECISION  (pure-delay S=10.5%, floor 2.2%)
====================================================================================================
   Even PERFECT sigma (e_sig->0) cannot beat the intrinsic s_FJ; precision is a WEAK lever.

   e_sig (IFU %)    s_ln    Nz(3s)    Nz(5s)
             0%    0.150        74      NO N
             3%    0.153        77      NO N
             5%    0.158        82      NO N
             8%    0.170        95      NO N
            12%    0.192       121      NO N

   e_sig 8% -> 0%: Nz(3s) moves 95 -> 74  (only x1.28).
   BINDING levers: (i) the systematic floor (ceiling), (ii) carrier COUNT, (iii) intrinsic s_FJ.

